description:
Establishment of a Dynamic Market pursuant to section 34 of the Procurement Act 2023 for the physical supply of electricity to all Authority sites along with associated invoicing and query management services. A Dynamic Market is a procurement mechanism that:
•remains open to new suppliers throughout its duration;
•allows suppliers to apply for admission at any time;
•enables the Authority to conduct competitive selection processes among admitted suppliers

The Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) requires the provision of integrated security services for the British High Commission, Lusaka, the High Commissioner’s Residence and diplomatic staff residences located in Lusaka, Zambia.
The requirement includes:
• Static guarding services;
• Mobile patrol and response services;
• Alarm monitoring and response services;
• Access control and visitor management;
• Security supervision and management;
• Incident response and reporting;
• Ope

