This tender relates to Demountable Classrooms works at St Martin's Church of England Primary School, Ranmore Road, Dorking RH4 1HW.
      
      The Works comprise the:
      - design, manufacture, delivery and installation of modular classroom
      accommodation;
      - associated groundworks and connections;
      - mechanical and electrical services installations;
      - internal fit-out and finishes;
      - testing, commissioning and handover.
      
